{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "账户就是输入",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 125.6,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "Solana 程序拿到的每一个账户，都是用户输入。",
   "spoken": "Solana 程序拿到的每一个账户，都是用户输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 1.692,
   "speechEnd": 4.825
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "第一件要查的，是 owner。这个账户，是不是归本程序所有。",
   "spoken": "第一件要查的，是 owner。这个账户，是不是归本程序所有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.26,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 5.353,
   "speechEnd": 9.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "第二件，是签名。管理员操作，必须检查管理员账户签了名。",
   "spoken": "第二件，是签名。管理员操作，必须检查管理员账户签了名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 10.2,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 10.294,
   "speechEnd": 15.223
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第三件，是类型。两种账户结构相同，攻击者就能拿一种冒充另一种。要靠判别字段区分。",
   "spoken": "第三件，是类型。两种账户结构相同，攻击者就能拿一种冒充另一种。要靠判别字段区分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 15.62,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 15.62,
   "speechEnd": 23.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "第四件，是跨程序调用的目标。program id 由调用者传进来，就必须核对。",
   "spoken": "第四件，是跨程序掉用的目标。program id 由掉用者传进来，就必须核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 24.16,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 24.16,
   "speechEnd": 31.423
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第五件，是系统账户。要用带校验的读取方式。Wormhole 缺的就是这一件。",
   "spoken": "第五件，是系统账户。要用带较验的读取方式。Wormhole 缺的就是这一件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 31.82,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 31.82,
   "speechEnd": 37.894
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "更隐蔽的一种，是信任链没有终点。",
   "spoken": "更隐蔽的一种，是信任链没有终点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 38.28,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 38.382,
   "speechEnd": 41.277
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "2022 年 3 月的 Cashio，存抵押品时，只检查了各个账户互相一致。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 3 月的 Cashio，存抵押品时，只检查了各个账户互相一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 41.7,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 41.805,
   "speechEnd": 47.51
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "铸币检查没有把 mint 字段，锚定到一个可信的根。",
   "spoken": "铸币检查没有把 mint 字段，锚定到一个可信的根。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 47.92,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 47.92,
   "speechEnd": 51.811
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "攻击者伪造了整条账户链，用没有价值的代币，铸出约 20 亿枚 CASH。",
   "spoken": "攻击者伪造了整条账户链，用没有价值的代币，铸出约 20 亿枚 CASH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 52.22,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 52.311,
   "speechEnd": 57.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "损失的估计，rekt.news 约 4800 万美元，CertiK 约 5280 万美元。",
   "spoken": "损失的估计，rekt.news 约 4800 万美元，CertiK 约 5280 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 58.2,
   "dur": 8.8,
   "speechStart": 58.2,
   "speechEnd": 66.814
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "账户之间再一致，也要有一端，落在硬编码的地址，或本程序的 PDA 上。",
   "spoken": "账户之间再一致，也要有一端，落在硬编码的地址，或本程序的 PDA 上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 67.22,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 67.22,
   "speechEnd": 72.945
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "PDA 要用规范的 bump。跨程序调用之后，要再次加载账户，不用内存里的旧数据。",
   "spoken": "PDA 要用规范的 bump。跨程序掉用之后，要再次加载账户，不用内存里的旧数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 73.36,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 73.36,
   "speechEnd": 80.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "Anchor 框架的账户约束，能自动做完大部分检查。但约束是开发者写的，漏写一个，就等于没有。",
   "spoken": "Anchor 框架的账户约束，能自动做完大部分检查。但约束是开发者写的，漏写一个，就等于没有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 80.54,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 80.637,
   "speechEnd": 88.524
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "签名的有效期，也是一种输入。",
   "spoken": "签名的有效期，也是一种输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 88.92,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 89.01,
   "speechEnd": 91.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2026 年 4 月，按 Chainalysis 的分析，Drift 损失约 2.85 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 4 月，按 Chainalysis 的分析，Drift 损失约 2.85 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 91.46,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 91.566,
   "speechEnd": 97.135
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "它的安全委员会，五个人里两人签名就能放行。迁移到新配置后，时间锁为零。",
   "spoken": "它的安全委员会，五个人里两人签名就能放行。迁移到新配置后，时间锁维零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 97.6,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 97.6,
   "speechEnd": 104.289
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "至少两名成员，签了自己没有完全理解的审批。",
   "spoken": "至少两名成员，签了自己没有完全理解的审批。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 104.7,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 104.7,
   "speechEnd": 108.257
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "Solana 的签名，本来约 1 分钟就会过期。持久 nonce 让这些签名长期有效。",
   "spoken": "Solana 的签名，本来约 1 分钟就会过期。持久 nonce 让这些签名长期有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 108.68,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 108.772,
   "speechEnd": 114.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "Chainalysis 也说明，这些描述来自 Drift 自己的调查，未经独立验证。",
   "spoken": "Chainalysis 也说明，这些描述来自 Drift 自己的掉查，未经独立验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 114.82,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 114.82,
   "speechEnd": 120.193
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "管理操作要加时间锁，执行前再确认一次。",
   "spoken": "管理操作要加时间锁，执行前再确认一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 120.64,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 120.734,
   "speechEnd": 124.216
  }
